		"notes": "\n\t<p><i>7 feet tall, 300 pounds. Humanoid demon coated with a thick, glossy sheen of sticky tar. Simple-minded soldiers of titan armies.</i></p>\n\t<p></p>\n\t<p><strong>AC</strong> 13, <strong>HP</strong> 42, <strong>ATK</strong> 3 +1 shortsword +7 (1d6+1 + tar), <strong>MV</strong> double near (fly), <strong>S</strong> +4, <strong>D</strong> +2, <strong>C</strong> +2, <strong>I</strong> +0, <strong>W</strong> +0, <strong>Ch</strong> +2, <strong>AL</strong> <strong>C</strong>, <strong>LV</strong> 9</p><p></p>\n\t<p><strong>Great Evil</strong>. Only damaged by silver or magical sources. Weapons dissolve if slain.</p><p></p><p><strong>Tar</strong>. Creatures, weapons, or objects touching STR 15+ or stuck to demodand. STR 15+ on turn to remove.</p><p></p>\n\t<p><i>Shadowfinder Complete Bestiary</i></p>",
